{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1478242-what-should-be-the-result-if-a-cammy-sees-all-their-touchstones-fused-into-a-vozhd","id":1478242,"title":"What should be the result if a Cammy sees all their touchstones fused into a vozhd?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-07T15:47:52-07:00","id":1478242,"title":"What should be the result if a Cammy sees all their touchstones fused into a vozhd?","content":"Let's say that the wall to a Cammy's haven is smashed down by a vozhd, and the Cammy sees that three of his touchstones are fused into the vozhd, looking kind of melted and shaped into a limb or whatever, but still recognizable. What should be the result in terms of stains and frenzy difficulty and so forth?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-07T16:28:39-07:00","id":1478244,"title":"","content":"6 stains and a 14 difficulty fury frenzy, assuming non-diminishing returns. Then it depends whom or what he targets during the frenzy: the vozhd or whatever sent it. If it's the former, you've probably spent weeks stalking one vampire and living people around him, like a Cammy sewer rat, for him to get splattered by a vozhd that you could have sicced on elysium or another asset with the element of surprise. Or if he's badass enough to survive, you'll have one jaded and acutely depressed Cammy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3523,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3523-spencer-from-the-hills","user":"Spencer from The Hills","date":". 04-07-2022, 07:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3523-spencer-from-the-hills","name":"Spencer from The Hills","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"546"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-07T16:35:45-07:00","id":1478245,"title":"","content":"The Cammy will finally have an excuse for all that moping.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-11T07:23:27-07:00","id":1478564,"title":"","content":"By RAW, 6 stains if the process was out of their control. If the character's actions directly resulted in the creation of the vozhd, then 9 stains. The upcoming fury frenzy is a flat 4, and will likely see the character attack the death machine that was once their touchstones. If the tzimisce is present however, they'll target them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><div align=\"left\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/7.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26764-vilenecromancer","name":"Vilenecromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26764_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","c